;---------------------------------------
; BEGIN DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------
<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "環境音\quiet-residential-area1.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "800" "3000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\ザッハ夜.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "600" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>"All right then, I'll go home and look into the past incident.
{PAUSE ""}
What I would like to ask of <STYLE ID="1">Senpai</STYLE> is whether anything comes to mind about the cause of <STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE>'s April sickness and her danger sense.
{PAUSE ""}
If you find out anything, please get in touch."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Okay."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> gave me a </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">"There's no helping it"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> sort of smile and agreed.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"All right then, be careful."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\自転車開始.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{PLAYSND "SE\自転車こぐ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHGVOL "VOICE" "0" "3000" "WAIT"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> rode off home on her bicycle.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "SE\自転車開始.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
"Now then, the Operation begins."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> seen off, I got on my own bicycle and put my foot to the pedal.</STYLE><PG>
"Huh?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">I noticed something wrong right away.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">The air had gone out of the bicycle's tire.</STYLE><PG>
{PLAYSND "日没廃校.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{STOPSND "SE" "3000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="3">Pushing the bicycle home is going to be quite a chore... but there's nothing else for it...</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">'s </STYLE><BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Be careful."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Those words stayed with me, unpleasantly.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\桜道夜.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">The daytime clouds had vanished completely, and everything around me was lit by moonlight.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">The cherry blossoms in that light were very beautiful.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Pushing the bicycle along, I went over this incident one more time.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">In fact, even </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> herself probably had not noticed the rule behind </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">'s intuition, but I had.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">'s intuition is this. The person who is going to come to harm says</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"I'm going over there," "I'm going to do that"</STYLE><BR>
<STYLE ID="3">directly to </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">,</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">or else </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> sees them do it. Only then does it function.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">So, if she learns the situation of the person who will come to harm only by </STYLE><STYLE ID="5" RUBY="でんぶん">hearsay</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, that intuition does not work.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">This time, even though her </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> was killed, the reason </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> did not notice must be that she heard about the business trip from someone else.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Probably from </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Kogori-senpai's mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> or someone like her.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">But... something is still missing.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">'s intuition: the condition it needs in order to work.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">There must be something more.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">Let me turn my mind back to the incident.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Could this incident not have been prevented?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">That is probably not so. To begin with, a culprit causes an incident for a purpose.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">Even if it is a thrill-killer, the purpose of wanting to be a thrill-killer is still there.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">In this case, let me assume not a thrill-killer but a copycat.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">Yes, that it is connected to the Megasawa City murders, and to the accident at Chuo Park 10 years ago.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">If I had grasped that in advance, I might have been able to stop it in some form.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Specifically, what kind of accident was the one at Chuo Park?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">I stopped walking and took out my smartphone.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\スマフォ黄入.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "650" "C" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">“</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Motoki-cho Chuo Park accident”</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">I searched on those words... and the results were all about the incident that happened today.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Let me narrow it down by date and search again.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">........................</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">There it is, this is the one!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9" RUBY="しよう">Shiyo</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> 788―exactly 12 years ago today―April 8.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Hanami visitor dies in accident at Chuo Park.</STYLE> [TN: hanami = cherry-blossom viewing]
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Fell from a cherry tree and died.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">The one who died was...</STYLE>
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">No way...</STYLE>
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<PG>
{PLAYSND "忍び寄る影.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="3">This can't be...!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Then, today, that person's―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">that person's behavior, what was it!?</STYLE><PG>
{PLAYSND "SE\se_maoudamashii_se_heartbeat01.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="3">My heartbeat was speeding up to an impossible rate.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{DELETECG "アイテム1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<STYLE ID="3">Why...! Is that person the culprit...!?</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">I can't stay here like this! I have to plan the next Operation, and fast!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">I took my eyes off the smartphone and lifted my head, and the cherry tree in front of me came into view.</STYLE><PG>
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
{STOPSND "SE" "0" "PASS"}
"............!!?"<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "明かされた真実.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\手直し・追加\桜道夜赤.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\赤い人立ち.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "600" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">Under the tree, a bright red person with the skin </STYLE><STYLE ID="10" RUBY="は">flayed</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> off was lit by the moonlight...!</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\うめき声.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\夢の目.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "50" "NORMAL" "SKIP"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\夢桜.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "NORMAL" "SKIP"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\赤顔.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "50" "NORMAL" "SKIP"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\手直し・追加\桜道夜赤.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "50" "NORMAL" "SKIP"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\夢の目.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "50" "NORMAL" "SKIP"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\手直し・追加\桜道夜赤.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "50" "NORMAL" "SKIP"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\赤顔.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "50" "NORMAL" "SKIP"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\手直し・追加\桜道夜赤.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\赤い人立ち.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "600" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="11">No, no!</STYLE><BR>
<STYLE ID="11">This is a hallucination!</STYLE><PG>
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<STYLE ID="3">I rubbed my eyes and looked at the tree again.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\quiet-residential-area1.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "500" "5000" "PASS"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "5000" "PASS"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\桜道夜.gal" "WAIT" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">What met my eyes was a bright red―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">just a bright red mailbox.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">I looked around, and there was not a single figure anywhere.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">It really had been a hallucination.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Seeing a hallucination like that, I must be truly </STYLE><STYLE ID="12" RUBY="おび">frightened</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> right now.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">That's right. I am very </STYLE><STYLE ID="12" RUBY="おび">frightened</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> right now.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Because today's incident is not over yet.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">It has only just begun.</STYLE><PG>
"To <STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE>... to <STYLE ID="2">Senpai</STYLE>...!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\スマフォ黄入.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "650" "C" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">. I tried to call her, but</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "500"}
{QUAKE "アイテム1" "QUAKE" "1" "15" "15" "500" "30"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">my hands were shaking, and the sweat on them got in the way of working it, so I could not dial the way I wanted.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{QUAKE "メッセージボックス土台" "QUAKE" "1" "15" "15" "0" "30"}
"Come on! Work, will you! At a time like this...!"
{QUAKESTOP "500"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">I pressed at the screen and swiped my finger across it with all my strength.</STYLE><PG>
"Ah!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n携帯落とす\r\nアイテム1\r\n4\r\n540\r\n200\r\nINC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "200" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n携帯落とす\r\nアイテム1\r\n4\r\n540\r\n0\r\nINC\r\nPASS">
{DELETECG "アイテム1" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯落とす.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">The smartphone slipped out of my shaking hands and fell into the storm drain.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">What do I do! At this rate it is not just a matter of the Operation failing! </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> is in danger!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">The next to be killed is </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, and then...!</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\自転車止める.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{PLAYSND "SE\アスファルトダッシュ.ogg" "VOICE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\道1夜ブラー.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">I let go of the punctured bicycle and ran for the police station with everything I had.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">I had no idea how many minutes it would take to get there.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Barely able to breathe, I ran as long as I could run.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "1000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\道1夜.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
"Haah! Haah!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">I put my hands on my knees and stopped.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">There was no sign of a person anywhere around, and no sound.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "SE\haa1.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="3">The sound of my own gasping was unpleasantly loud in my ears.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"<STYLE ID="2">Senpai</STYLE>... <STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE>...!"<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">A dark road with few streetlights stretched on ahead.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">The moon seemed to be hidden, and I could not see far ahead.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">Wait. What am I panicking for!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">There is no need at all for me to go to the police station myself! All I have to do is borrow a phone from a house nearby!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Just as I made to start running again,</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\棒を振る.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{STOPSND "SE" "0" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "SE\tackle1.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
